<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hey! I found him!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―So he cut his own throat with a nata...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="けんご">Kengo</STYLE>-kun?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―He's on his way here now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\hito_ge_run_kusa01.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Dad! Hey, Dad!"
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Kengo-kun, don't touch him!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But Dad...!
{PAUSE ""}
　Damn it...! Why'd you have to die...!
{PAUSE ""}
　Why..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Kengo-kun..."<PG>
"I know! I know this is that kind of place... 
{PAUSE ""}
But why Dad... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hey! Was it really suicide!? Isn't there a chance he was killed...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"He cut his throat this deep in the mountains. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even if someone killed him and then dumped him here, no human could carry a grown man all the way up here in this downpour..."<PG>
"But Dad had a bad leg!?
{PAUSE ""}
　You're saying he walked all the way up here on his own!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Listen, Kengo-kun..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"When did you last see your father?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"This morning... 
{PAUSE ""}
Around 5 in the morning, he said he was going to check on the fields..."<PG>
"If someone called your father out at 5, killed him, carried him up here, and then went back to the settlement in this weather, how many hours would that take?
{PAUSE ""}
　Everyone gathered at 7 in the morning and set out to search."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"More than anything, you understand, don't you?
{PAUSE ""}
　As long as you live here, once you turn 75―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's enough! I won't believe it! That Dad killed himself!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\hito_ge_run_kusa01.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Kengo-kun..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It can't be helped... I couldn't believe it either when my dad died.<BR>
"Will I end up like this someday too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Maybe. 
{PAUSE ""}
But I'm not running. My place has been here since the day I was born. 
{PAUSE ""}
However I die, I'm not going to abandon the land handed down from my ancestors.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
